{"4452340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Toilet", "steam_appid": 4452340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is dying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toxic air, mutant creatures, and endless drought have pushed humanity to the brink of extinction. Your mission is simple: survive, restore the atmosphere, and give humanity a second chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the wasteland with your mobile Transport Mech, gather resources, build automated production chains, and rescue survivors. Convert waste into fuel, power mysterious purification systems, and slowly reclaim the planet from contamination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the atmosphere improves, new opportunities emerge—but so do new dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand automated production networks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate and upgrade your Transport Mech mobile base</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore the atmosphere and transform the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue, heal, and manage human survivors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct conveyor, power, and resource systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous post-apocalyptic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hostile mutant creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete story-driven objectives and uncover the truth behind the disaster</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity's future depends on your decisions.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is dying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toxic air, mutant creatures, and endless drought have pushed humanity to the brink of extinction. Your mission is simple: survive, restore the atmosphere, and give humanity a second chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the was